<title>USA: Ault to trade on Nasdaq National Market.</title>
<headline>Ault to trade on Nasdaq National Market.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ault Inc said it will start trading on Wednesday on the Nasdaq National Market. It previously traded on the Nasdaq Small-Cap market.</p>
<p>Earlier this week the manufacturer of external power conversion products filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a public offering of 1.8 million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>At September 1, the end of its first quarter, the company reported 2.4 million average shares outstanding.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
